{
  "id": "poem-e26094c03e895db6122aeea8",
  "title": "点绛唇·不昧本来",
  "author": "向子𬤇",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "不昧本来，太虚明月流辉过。",
    "令行独坐。",
    "高下都由我。",
    "玉轸无弦，谁对秋风和。",
    "还知么。",
    "老庞一个。",
    "识得机关破。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.2000.json#record-150",
